:"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, February to March has come in under 90% of normal in 45 of 75 years since 1951 on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids. In 2025 that pair came in at 2% of normal on the middle, and in 2026 March to April came in at 5% on the middle. Every grid had its driest year in 2011, with grid 15410 at 24% of normal that year.</p>"}
